# SubC Test Suites

Test suites to validate SubC compiler conformance with the C89 standard.

## Test Suites

| Suite | Location | Description |
|-------|----------|-------------|
| C89 Suite | `tests/c89_suite/` | Core language features, operators, types |
| Preprocessor Suite | `tests/preproc_suite/` | Preprocessor directives, predefined macros |

