# C89 Test Suite

## Location

Tests are located in `tests/c89_suite/`.

## Usage

```bash
cd tests/c89_suite

# Run all tests
./run_tests.sh

# Compile only (check for compilation errors)
./run_tests.sh -c

# Compare mode: SubC vs GCC/Clang
./run_tests.sh -C

# Keep generated .s files in output/
./run_tests.sh -k

# Run a specific test
./run_tests.sh -s t_vtable

# Verbose (show error details)
./run_tests.sh -v

# Combined
./run_tests.sh -C -k -v
```

## Structure

```
tests/c89_suite/
├── run_tests.sh      # Test runner script
├── output/           # Generated files (git-ignored)
│   ├── subc/         # Assembly generated by SubC
│   └── native/       # Native compiler binaries
└── t_*.c             # Test files
```

